Package: childmortality
Type: Package
Title: Indirect Estimation of Infant and Under-Five Mortality
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ricardo", "Campante-Vale", email = "ricardo.vale@ipea.gov.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Indirect estimation of infant (1q0) and under-five (5q0) mortality from summary
    birth histories (children ever born and children dead by age of mother),
    as collected in the Brazilian census. Implements the Brass method in the
    Trussell variant (Coale-Demeny model life tables) and the Palloni-Heligman
    variant (UN model life tables, using the mean age at maternity), with
    coefficients from Hill 2013, IUSSP Tools for Demographic Estimation, and
    conversion of estimates to a common index through relational logit model
    life tables.
